offset_top = 40.0
offset_right = 1052.0
offset_bottom = 262.0
text = "It does sound logical doesn't it? However none of what we know points to any of these conflicts being connected. Even then, it's none of our business if there is any connection between these or not. We're being called in to protect the peace and put a stop to the conflicts here. "
